  "Language: Youdao's text GGUF (general.architecture = qwen3vl, general.name unrecognisable: use -f qwen3-asr).",
  "Decoder = Qwen3-1.7B shape, but 4-bit RTN (Q4_0/Q4_1/Q4_K) breaks this model (empty or wrong-language transcripts); Q8_0 is lossless.",
  "So default_tensor_type is Q8_0 with plain 32-row column-major blocks (parallel_size 32, what _pack_q8nx and the generic decode layer's __Q8_0__ expect).",
  "Audio tower: HF tensor names (thinker.audio_tower.*, identical to qwen3.5-omni minus conv2d4), kept BF16 with the audio MM tile re-order; convert from a GGUF made with load_safetensor_to_gguf.py, -t audio."
